  "body": "Auction: Cnr Tamaki Dr and St Heliers Bay Rd (Branch Office) on Tuesday 8 December 2026 at 11:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFour years young and presenting as new, this beautifully appointed Principle Homes executive residence offers the space, quality and smart technology of a substantial modern home, without the stress of building from scratch or renovating. Thoughtfully designed for immaculate living and entertaining, it's ideal for those ready to leave the ongoing maintenance of an older home behind and simply enjoy where they live.\r\n\r\nAn attractive cedar-clad exterior sets the scene for timeless, tasteful interiors, where engineered oak flooring, high ceilings and quality finishes set a consistent high standard throughout.\r\n\r\nSpace is certainly not in short supply. Four generously sized bedrooms, each with a walk-in wardrobe, complement multiple living areas. Upstairs, a separate lounge between the bedrooms provides an escape for the kids, while the primary suite is a welcome parents' haven, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and luxurious ensuite. Downstairs, a substantial media room with an adjacent full bathroom and storage offers flexibility as a fifth bedroom for guests or extended family.\r\n\r\n The beautifully appointed kitchen features high-end appliances, double ovens and a separate pantry, connecting naturally with open-plan dining and living, where a gas fire adds warmth and atmosphere. Two outdoor entertaining areas extend the options, with automated louvres and outdoor heating for year-round enjoyment. There's even a private putting green for a little friendly competition with family or friends.\r\n\r\nSmart technology makes everyday living easier, with Wi-Fi-controlled central heating and cooling, automated blinds, underfloor bathroom heating and comprehensive security with video monitoring and remote access. Practical details are equally well considered, including a central vacuum system, EV charger, dedicated laundry, double garage and additional roof storage.\r\n\r\nThe location adds another dimension. Set in a quiet, tree-lined Glendowie avenue, you're within easy reach of highly regarded schools, St Heliers Beach and Village, Churchill Park and the wider Eastern Bays.\r\n\r\nGive yourself the gift of more time to enjoy living and less to worry about at home.",
